                <pb facs="0619" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg517"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6292/130.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Japanese Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buena Vista
                                Spring, Pa.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-09-01"><hi rendition="#italic">September 1,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am informed that imperial decree to postpone exposition will be dated September
                    1, but published in Official Gazette of 2d to-morrow. This is on line agreed
                    upon Sunday. I also telegraphed to the President.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Takahira.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
